# Vulnerability details

## Impact

Debt is incurred twice.

## Proof of Concept

When a user interacts with the main functions of CDPVault, eg deposit, borrow, repay, withdraw, `modifyCollateralAndDebt()` is invoked.

If the position has a borrowed position, debt needs to be calculated as time pass. `_calcDebt()` will be called to calculate the debt incurred.

```
